  "No storage settings on this device. Format the drive as FAT32 on a computer — every Android box accepts it.": "Níl socruithe stórála ar an ngléas seo. Formáidigh an diosca mar FAT32 ar ríomhaire — glacann gach bosca Android leis.",
  "No subtitles found.": "Níor aimsíodh aon fhotheideal.",
  "No title or IMDb id for this stream, so nothing to search by.": "Níl teideal ná aitheantas IMDb ann don sruth seo, mar sin níl aon rud le cuardach leis.",
  "No torrents match this filter.": "Níl aon torrent ag teacht leis an scagaire seo.",
  "None": "Ceann ar bith",
  "Normal": "Gnáth",
  "Normal speed": "Gnáthluas",
  "Not now": "Ní anois",
  "Not supported yet": "Gan tacaíocht fós",
  "Nothing certain in the last twenty minutes — listening to the whole film…": "Faic cinnte sna fiche nóiméad deireanacha — ag éisteacht leis an scannán ar fad…",
  "Nothing chosen yet, so the background is a flat colour for now.": "Níl aon rud roghnaithe fós, mar sin is dath comhréidh é an cúlra go fóill.",
  "Nothing downloading.": "Níl aon rud á íoslódáil.",
  "Nothing here.": "Níl aon rud anseo.",
  "Nothing matches.": "Níl aon rud ag teacht leis.",
  "Nothing on this device can open that file. HEVC/x265 and AV1 depend on the hardware decoder, and older boxes have neither — try a 1080p x264 release.": "Ní féidir le haon rud ar an ngléas seo an comhad sin a oscailt. Braitheann HEVC/x265 agus AV1 ar an díchódóir crua-earraí, agus níl ceachtar acu ag boscaí níos sine — bain triail as eisiúint 1080p x264.",
  "Nothing to play": "Níl aon rud le seinm",
  "Off": "As",
  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "Nuair atá sé as, fágtar do chúlra féin as an áireamh: coinníonn an téama a dhathanna féin fad is atá an pictiúr le feiceáil, agus ní athraíonn sé ach nuair a chlúdaíonn ealaín teidil é.",
  "On the air": "Á chraoladh",
  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "Nuair atá sé ar siúl, leanann an cúlra an cárta a bhfuil tú ag díriú air nó atá roghnaithe agat. Nuair atá sé as, ní athraíonn sé ach nuair a osclaíonn tú rud éigin i ndáiríre — níos socra ar liosta fada, áit a n-athphéinteálfadh scuabadh trasna ró an fhuinneog ar fad cárta ar chárta.",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Nuair atá sé ar siúl, is ar do phictiúr atá an feidhmchlár ina luí, agus clúdaíonn an ealaín é fad is atá tú ar scannán nó ar shraith. Nuair atá sé as, fanann an pictiúr san áit a bhfuil sé agus ní chlúdaíonn aon rud é riamh.",
  "One colour, and Material's own generator works out the rest of the palette from it.": "Dath amháin, agus oibríonn gineadóir Material féin an chuid eile den phaileit amach uaidh.",
  "One earlier episode in this season is still unwatched.": "Tá eachtra amháin níos luaithe sa séasúr seo gan féachaint fós.",
  "One earlier season is still unwatched.": "Tá séasúr amháin níos luaithe gan féachaint fós.",
  "One-off or monthly, from any card or PayPal. Ko-fi takes no cut of it.": "Uair amháin nó gach mí, le cárta ar bith nó trí PayPal. Ní ghlacann Ko-fi aon sciar de.",
  "Only download on Wi-Fi": "Íoslódáil ar Wi-Fi amháin",
  "Only downloaded subtitles can be synced; the file's own tracks already match it.": "Ní féidir ach fotheidil a íoslódáladh a shioncronú; réitíonn rianta an chomhaid féin leis cheana.",
  "Only needed if the app stops loading artwork and titles. Create one free under your TMDB account settings, API, “API Read Access Token”. It is kept out of backup files.": "Ní theastaíonn sé ach má stopann an feidhmchlár de bheith ag lódáil ealaíne agus teideal. Cruthaigh ceann saor in aisce faoi shocruithe do chuntais TMDB, API, “API Read Access Token”. Coinnítear as comhaid chúltaca é.",
