  "That backup is empty.": "Tá an cúltaca sin folamh.",
  "That backup is in format {version}, which this build doesn't know how to read.": "Tá an cúltaca sin i bhformáid {version}, rud nach eol don tógáil seo conas a léamh.",
  "That doesn't look like a URL. Paste an addon link, or one starting with https://": "Ní cosúil gur URL é sin. Greamaigh nasc breiseáin, nó ceann a thosaíonn le https://",
  "That file isn't JSON, so it isn't a backup.": "Ní JSON é an comhad sin, mar sin ní cúltaca é.",
  "That isn't a Ventic backup.": "Ní cúltaca Ventic é sin.",
  "That picture couldn't be saved. Try a smaller one, or a JPEG or PNG.": "Níorbh fhéidir an pictiúr sin a shábháil. Bain triail as ceann níos lú, nó as JPEG nó PNG.",
  "That source is already in the list.": "Tá an fhoinse sin sa liosta cheana.",
  "That torrent holds no video file.": "Níl aon chomhad físe sa torrent sin.",
  "That's everything.": "Sin an méid.",
  "The connection to the torrent engine dropped mid-stream.": "Bhris an nasc leis an inneall torrent i lár an tsrutha.",
  "The download couldn't be started.": "Níorbh fhéidir an íoslódáil a thosú.",
  "The download didn't finish.": "Níor chríochnaigh an íoslódáil.",
  "The exception is Dolby or DTS handed straight to a receiver over HDMI, which Android does where it can — nothing in the app touches that sound, so neither setting has any effect on it. An amplifier doing that has a night mode of its own.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The exception is Dolby or DTS handed straight to a receiver over HDMI, which Android does where it can — nothing in the app touches that sound, so neither setting has any effect on it. An amplifier doing that has a night mode of its own.",
  "The film is played as it was mixed.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The film is played as it was mixed.",
  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "D'fhreagair an nasc a thug an fhoinse seo HTTP {status}. B'fhéidir gur imigh sé i léig — cuardaigh na foinsí arís le ceann úr a fháil.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Níorbh fhéidir teacht ar an nasc a thug an fhoinse seo.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "An pictiúr atá taobh thiar den fheidhmchlár faoi láthair",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Ní bhfuair limistéar an tseinnteora méid riamh, mar sin níor tosaíodh an athsheinm.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "An seinnteoir féin — díchódú, fotheidil agus fuaim. GPLv2 nó níos déanaí.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Ní óstálann, ní reáchtálann, ní fhormhuiníonn ná ní mholann an tionscadal aon fhoinse, agus ní dháileann sé liosta díobh.",
  "The project on GitHub": "An tionscadal ar GitHub",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Níl aon nuashonrú don ardán seo san eisiúint.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Fuair an fhoinse é seo cheana — seinneann sé láithreach agus ní choinníonn sé aon rud ar an ngléas seo",
  "The supporter list couldn't be loaded — the Ko-fi page above has the current one.": "Níorbh fhéidir liosta na dtacadóirí a lódáil — tá an ceann reatha ar leathanach Ko-fi thuas.",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Ghlac an t-inneall torrent leis an magnet ach níor thug sé aitheantas dó.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "An t-inneall torrent, leabaithe san fheidhmchlár. Ceadúnas MIT.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Níl an sruth torrent réidh fós (d'fhreagair an t-inneall HTTP {status}). B'fhéidir go bhfuil sé fós ag fáil meiteashonraí ó phiaraí.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Níorbh fhéidir an nuashonrú a shuiteáil: {error}",
  "Theme": "Téama",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Is ar éigean atá spás d'aon scannán amháin anseo. Plugáil diosca USB isteach sa bhosca — formáidithe mar FAT32, rud a ghlacann gach bosca Android leis — agus taispeánfar thuas é chun íoslódáil air ina áit.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Níl aon chuntas ann le sínigh isteach ann agus ní shioncronaítear aon rud le freastalaí. Stóráiltear an méid a bhreathnaíonn tú air, cé chomh fada is a chuaigh tú, do cheanáin agus do liosta faire go léir ar an ngléas seo agus ní fhágann siad é riamh. Tá sioncronú idir scáileáin beartaithe; go dtí sin, is é an cúltaca thíos an bealach a bhogann leabharlann.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Níl aon {file} i d'fhillteán cáipéisí. Cóipeáil ceann ann agus bain triail eile as.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Tá an nasc seo méadraithe faoi láthair.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Níl an nasc seo méadraithe faoi láthair.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Níorbh é suiteálaí Ventic féin a shuiteáil an chóip seo — bainisteoir pacáistí, nó tógáil ón bhfoinse — mar sin is é an rud a chuir ann é a nuashonraíonn é. Ní dhéanfadh na comhaid a athsholáthar as seo ach mearbhall a chur air.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Thug díchódóir an ghléis seo suas ar an gcomhad. Is í an fhuaim is cúis leis de ghnáth: níl Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) ná DTS ceadúnaithe san amharc gréasáin córais, mar sin seinneann eisiúint a bhfuil ceann acu inti mar phictiúr gan fuaim, nó ní sheinneann sí ar chor ar bith. Seinnfidh eisiúint x264 le fuaim AAC.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Níl ach rian fuaime amháin sa chomhad seo.",
