  "Try again": "Bain triail eile as",
  "Turn subtitles on by themselves whenever a film starts, in the language you pick here.": "Cuir fotheidil ar siúl leo féin nuair a thosaíonn scannán, sa teanga a roghnaíonn tú anseo.",
  "Turns off the effects that cost the most to draw: the frosted blur behind the sidebar and menus, the blur on the background art, and the fades and slides that play as things appear or take focus. Everything stays where it was and nothing is hidden — it stops moving and goes crisp instead. Loading spinners keep turning.": "Múchann sé na héifeachtaí is costasaí le tarraingt: an doiléiriú sioctha taobh thiar den bharra taoibh agus na roghchláir, an doiléiriú ar ealaín an chúlra, agus na céimnithe agus na sleamhnáin a sheinntear agus rudaí ag teacht chun cinn nó ag fáil fócais. Fanann gach rud san áit a raibh sé agus ní cheiltear aon rud — stopann sé de bheith ag bogadh agus éiríonn sé géar ina ionad. Leanann na rothlóirí lódála ag casadh.",
  "Type in the search box to find movies and shows.": "Clóscríobh sa bhosca cuardaigh chun scannáin agus sraitheanna a aimsiú.",
  "Unmute (m)": "Díbhalbhaigh (m)",
  "Unreadable": "Doléite",
  "Untitled": "Gan teideal",
  "Upcoming": "Ag teacht",
  "Update now": "Nuashonraigh anois",
  "Updates": "Nuashonruithe",
  "Updates are checked in the installed app, not here.": "Seiceáiltear nuashonruithe san fheidhmchlár suiteáilte, ní anseo.",
  "Upload": "Uaslódáil",
  "Use default": "Úsáid an réamhshocrú",
  "Use this colour": "Úsáid an dath seo",
  "Ventic asks a source for {movie}, or {series}, and expects a {streams} array back. Add several and their results are merged, with duplicates dropped and earlier sources preferred.": "Iarrann Ventic {movie}, nó {series}, ar fhoinse, agus tá súil aige le heagar {streams} ar ais. Cuir roinnt leis agus cumasctar a dtorthaí, fágtar dúblaigh ar lár agus tugtar tosaíocht d'fhoinsí níos luaithe.",
  "Ventic downloads the new package and Android asks you to confirm the install. It is signed with the same key as the copy you have, so it upgrades in place and keeps your library.": "Íoslódálann Ventic an pacáiste nua agus iarrann Android ort an tsuiteáil a dheimhniú. Tá sé sínithe leis an eochair chéanna leis an gcóip atá agat, mar sin uasghrádaíonn sé ina áit agus coinníonn sé do leabharlann.",
  "Ventic has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "Níl aon fhoinse cumraithe ag Ventic, mar sin níl aon áit ann le cuardach. Is féidir leat magnet nó comhad torrent a osclaíonn tú féin a sheinm fós.",
  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "Ní óstálann Ventic aon ábhar, ní innéacsaíonn sé aon ábhar, agus seoltar é gan aon fhoinse cumraithe. Is cliant BitTorrent é le seinnteoir ceangailte leis: ní fhaigheann sé ach an rud a dhíríonn tú air, ó fhreastalaithe a chuir tú féin leis.",
  "Ventic is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "Tá Ventic faoi cheadúnas MIT. Coinníonn na comhpháirteanna ar a bhfuil sé tógtha a dtéarmaí féin, atá liostaithe thuas; ar Windows is bogearraí GPL é an mpv atá san áireamh agus tá a cheadúnas agus a thairiscint foinse in aice le comhad inrite an fheidhmchláir.",
  "Ventic is free, has no ads, no account and nothing to sell. It costs money to sign, host and keep running — a donation is what covers that, and nothing in the app changes whether you give one or not.": "Tá Ventic saor in aisce, gan fógraí, gan cuntas agus gan aon rud le díol. Cosnaíonn sé airgead é a shíniú, a óstáil agus a choinneáil ag imeacht — is é síntiús a chlúdaíonn é sin, agus ní athraíonn aon rud san fheidhmchlár cibé an dtugann tú ceann nó nach dtugann.",
  "Ventic is up to date.": "Tá Ventic cothrom le dáta.",
  "Ventic keeps your library on this device. Carrying it to another screen is the backup file below.": "Coinníonn Ventic do leabharlann ar an ngléas seo. Is é an comhad cúltaca thíos an bealach chun í a iompar chuig scáileán eile.",
  "Ventic searches nothing by itself. A source is a URL you add here, pointing at a server that answers with things to play. What a source offers, and whether you have the right to play it, is between you and whoever runs it.": "Ní chuardaíonn Ventic aon rud as a stuaim féin. Is éard is foinse ann URL a chuireann tú leis anseo, ag díriú ar fhreastalaí a fhreagraíonn le rudaí le seinm. Is idir tú féin agus an duine a reáchtálann í atá an méid a thairgeann foinse, agus cé acu an bhfuil sé de cheart agat é a sheinm.",
  "Ventic speaks the {protocol}. Any Stremio addon URL works here — paste the {link} link or the {manifest} address and it'll be trimmed to what's needed.": "Labhraíonn Ventic an {protocol}. Oibríonn aon URL breiseáin Stremio anseo — greamaigh an nasc {link} nó an seoladh {manifest} agus bearrfar é go dtí an méid atá riachtanach.",
  "Ventic will send it the title you're looking for and play what it hands back. Only add servers you trust — this one is not run by, or checked by, this app.": "Seolfaidh Ventic chuige an teideal atá á lorg agat agus seinnfidh sé an rud a thugann sé ar ais. Ná cuir leis ach freastalaithe a bhfuil muinín agat astu — ní reáchtálann ná ní sheiceálann an feidhmchlár seo é seo.",
  "Ventic {version} is out": "Tá Ventic {version} amuigh",
